  "about": "The hivemindos.app link shapes the host may write into a card, README, note, post or email footer (HB-067 C). {n} is an agent number, {address} a 0x address; a trailing slash, a query and a #fragment do not change a shape. kind: page answers 200 (after any redirect), redirect answers 3xx and then 200 (redirect, allowed), auth answers 401 or 403 with no token (auth, allowed). Read by scripts/link_registry.py; seeded 22 Nov 2026 from every hivemindos.app link in hivepunk-547, 632, 667, 1071 and 86 and the Hugging Face card footer, each sample fetched once. Two shapes found there are not registered because they answered 404: /agents/hivepunkz (no number) and /notes/{slug}.",
